{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301224","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301224","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430122401:0":{"text":"그랬구나... 사실 나도 이전에 누군가에 들은 게 좀 있어.","source_cn":"原来是这样……之前也有人告诉了我一些情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF80D20E45794754E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430122402:0":{"text":"이제 많은 것이 바뀌겠지... 그래도 마을의 제작용 화로는 아직 꺼지지 않았잖아?","source_cn":"我知道接下来很多事情将会发生变化……但是村子里用来的锻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4CA9F77B5417EE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430122403:0":{"text":"난 그냥 이 목재들이 무사히 화로 속으로 들어가기만 하면 돼.","source_cn":"对我而言想再多也没用，我只要保证这些木头最终都能进入炉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4A1BBDE46B9BD7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工诺力":{"text":"현장 감독 노리","source":"监工诺力","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}